{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"28864c0f4965ae24","__entryId":"style-neumorphism","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene\"><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-top\"><span>HOME / LIVING ROOM</span><b>23:14</b></div><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-content\"><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-dial\"><small>室内温度</small><b>24°</b><span>舒适</span></div><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-controls\"><div><i class=\"lamp\"></i><b>阅读灯</b><span>40% brightness</span></div><div class=\"pressed\"><i class=\"moon\"></i><b>夜间氛围</b><span>已开启</span></div></div></div><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-note\">低风险控制 · 关键安全设备不使用新拟态</div></div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#e3e9f2;border-radius:18px;padding:24px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:18px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn big\">◐</span>\n        <span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn big in\">♪</span>\n        <span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:110px;height:44px;border-radius:22px;justify-content:flex-start;padding:0 8px\"><span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn\" style=\"width:30px;height:30px\"></span></span>\n        <span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip in\" style=\"width:110px;height:44px;border-radius:22px\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:320px;margin:18px auto 0\">\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-track\"><i style=\"width:62%\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-track\"><i style=\"width:30%\"></i></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#96a1b8;margin-top:16px\">Dribbble 概念稿 · 展示功力，不上线</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #eceef2;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">工作台</div>\n      <div style=\"padding:16px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">本周数据</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin:4px 0 8px\">播放量与互动都在涨，继续保持。</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand)\">查看详情 →</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#e3e9f2;border-radius:14px;padding:12px\">\n          <span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:104px\">播放量 12k</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:0 16px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">正确姿势：一张新拟态卡当装饰，其余照常</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#e3e9f2;border-radius:18px;padding:26px\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto\">\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-name\" style=\"font-size:15px;text-align:center\">登录</div>\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-chip in\" style=\"width:100%;height:38px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:14px;justify-content:flex-start;padding:0 14px\">邮箱</div>\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-chip in\" style=\"width:100%;height:38px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:10px;justify-content:flex-start;padding:0 14px\">密码</div>\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:100%;height:40px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:14px\">登录</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#c25454;text-align:center\">↑ 找出输入框和登录按钮——这就是它不能上线的原因</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene\"><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-top\"><span>HOME / LIVING ROOM</span><b>23:14</b></div><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-content\"><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-dial\"><small>Indoor temperature</small><b>24°</b><span>Comfortable</span></div><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-controls\"><div><i class=\"lamp\"></i><b>Reading lamp</b><span>40% brightness</span></div><div class=\"pressed\"><i class=\"moon\"></i><b>Night Ambience</b><span>Enabled</span></div></div></div><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-note\">Low-risk control · Critical safety equipment does not use neomorphism</div></div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#e3e9f2;border-radius:18px;padding:24px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:18px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn big\">◐</span>\n        <span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn big in\">♪</span>\n        <span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:110px;height:44px;border-radius:22px;justify-content:flex-start;padding:0 8px\"><span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn\" style=\"width:30px;height:30px\"></span></span>\n        <span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip in\" style=\"width:110px;height:44px;border-radius:22px\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:320px;margin:18px auto 0\">\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-track\"><i style=\"width:62%\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-track\"><i style=\"width:30%\"></i></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#96a1b8;margin-top:16px\">Dribbble concept draft · Demonstrate skills, not online</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #eceef2;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">Workbench</div>\n      <div style=\"padding:16px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">This week’s data</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin:4px 0 8px\">The number of views and interactions are increasing, and they will continue to grow. </div>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand)\">View details →</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#e3e9f2;border-radius:14px;padding:12px\">\n          <span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:104px\">12k views</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:0 16px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Correct posture: a new mimic card is used as decoration, and the rest is as usual</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#e3e9f2;border-radius:18px;padding:26px\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto\">\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-name\" style=\"font-size:15px;text-align:center\">Login</div>\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-chip in\" style=\"width:100%;height:38px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:14px;justify-content:flex-start;padding:0 14px\">Email</div>\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-chip in\" style=\"width:100%;height:38px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:10px;justify-content:flex-start;padding:0 14px\">Password</div>\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:100%;height:40px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:14px\">Login</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#c25454;text-align:center\">↑ Find the input box and login button - this is why it cannot go online</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<div class=\"style-neumorphism-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap style-neumorphism-chip\" data-ap=\"base\" style=\"box-shadow:none;border:1px dashed #b4bfd2\">同色底 #e3e9f2</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-neumorphism-chip\" data-ap=\"light\">↖ 白色柔光</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-neumorphism-chip\" data-ap=\"dark\">↘ 灰蓝暗影</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-neumorphism-chip\" data-ap=\"radius\" style=\"border-radius:20px\">柔和大圆角</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-neumorphism-chip in\" data-ap=\"inset\">凹陷按下</span>\n    </div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"style-neumorphism-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap style-neumorphism-chip\" data-ap=\"base\" style=\"box-shadow:none;border:1px dashed #b4bfd2\">Same color base #e3e9f2</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-neumorphism-chip\" data-ap=\"light\">↖ white soft light</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-neumorphism-chip\" data-ap=\"dark\">↘ gray-blue shadow</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-neumorphism-chip\" data-ap=\"radius\" style=\"border-radius:20px\">Soft large rounded corners</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-neumorphism-chip in\" data-ap=\"inset\">Depressed press</span>\n    </div>","parts":[{"key":"base","cn":"相近底色","en":"Shared Base","desc":"使用相近背景统一视觉，但需额外提供可读的文字和控件边界","desc_en":"Use similar backgrounds to unify vision, but provide additional readable text and control boundaries."},{"key":"light","cn":"柔光","en":"Light Shadow","desc":"柔和高光可暗示光源方向，不应成为唯一的状态提示","desc_en":"Soft highlights can hint at the direction of the light source and should not be the only status indicator"},{"key":"dark","cn":"暗影","en":"Dark Shadow","desc":"暗影可补充体积感；强度以不干扰文字和焦点为准","desc_en":"Shadows can add volume; be strong enough not to interfere with text and focus"},{"key":"radius","cn":"柔和边角","en":"Soft Radius","desc":"圆角大小跟随组件和品牌；不要让轮廓因此难以识别","desc_en":"Fillet size follows component and brand; don’t make outlines difficult to recognize"},{"key":"inset","cn":"凹陷层次","en":"Inset State","desc":"凹陷效果可表现槽位或层次，激活状态仍应使用明确标签和反馈","desc_en":"The indentation effect can represent slots or levels, and active states should still use clear labels and feedback"}]},"use":[{"t":"音乐播放器等重氛围、低操作密度的界面","m":"style-neumorphism-music"},{"t":"概念稿和作品集，用于展示材质方向","m":"style-neumorphism-concept"},{"t":"真实产品中的一小块装饰或控制区域","m":"style-neumorphism-deco"},{"t":"时钟、天气等以查看为主的小组件","m":"style-neumorphism-widget"}],"dont":[{"t":"长篇正文使用低对比灰色文字和背景","m":"style-neumorphism-text-bad","bad":true},{"t":"输入框与背景没有边界，用户难以发现","m":"style-neumorphism-form-bad","bad":true},{"t":"关键按钮只靠浅阴影表达可点击状态","m":"style-neumorphism-button-bad","bad":true},{"t":"没有验证对比度，就用于核心产品流程","m":"style-neumorphism-a11y-bad","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"使用方向相反的一浅一深两道阴影表现凸起","m":"style-neumorphism-twins"},{"t":"背景与组件可以接近同色，但边界仍要能够识别","m":"style-neumorphism-samecolor"},{"t":"凸起和凹下可以辅助表达状态，不能成为唯一信号","m":"style-neumorphism-extrude"},{"t":"圆角与柔和阴影要和组件尺寸保持协调","m":"style-neumorphism-soft"},{"t":"在文字、焦点和关键操作上优先满足对比度要求","m":"style-neumorphism-contrast"}],"history":[{"year":"2019.12","title":"概念稿引发关注","desc":"一组银行 App 概念稿带动了对同色背景、凸起按钮效果的讨论，随后常被称为 Neumorphism 或 Soft UI。","year_en":"December 2019","title_en":"A banking concept goes viral","desc_en":"Alexander Plyuto's concept showed controls appearing to press out of a same-colored surface and drew exceptional attention on design platforms."},{"year":"2020","title":"教程与概念稿扩散","desc":"相关教程、组件和生成工具增多，更多设计师开始尝试这种柔和的明暗层次。","year_en":"2020","title_en":"Soft UI reaches its peak","desc_en":"The style gained the name Neumorphism, and tutorials, UI kits, and generators appeared across the design community."},{"year":"2020—2021","title":"可用性讨论增加","desc":"研究与实践常指出：低对比度和不清晰的可操作边界会带来无障碍风险；采用时需要逐项测试。","year_en":"2020–2021","title_en":"Accessibility criticism follows","desc_en":"Very low contrast made controls and backgrounds difficult to distinguish, especially in bright conditions, so real product adoption stayed limited."},{"year":"今天","title":"多用于局部探索","desc":"它仍见于概念稿、播放器和局部装饰；在任务密集或高风险场景中，应以可读性和明确反馈为先。","year_en":"Today","title_en":"The style returns to a decorative role","desc_en":"Neumorphism now appears mainly in concept work, media controls, and isolated accents rather than complete production interfaces."}],"prompt":"做一个智能家居的只读状态小组件，展示室温和空气质量，并用柔和层次增加触感。所有文字、状态和可操作控件必须保持足够对比；安全或高风险操作使用更明确的常规控件。只显示设备真实返回的数据，缺少读数时显示“暂无数据”，不要补造数值。","prompt_en":"Small neumorphic media widget on #e3e9f2, paired light and dark soft shadows, extruded controls, large rounded corners, visible labels and outlines, contrast kept above accessibility requirements","scenes":["新拟态氛围家居","新拟态概念控制面板","产品界面的局部点缀","整页新拟态的可读性检查"],"en":{"prompt":"Small neumorphic media widget on #e3e9f2, paired light and dark soft shadows, extruded controls, large rounded corners, visible labels and outlines, contrast kept above accessibility requirements","use":[{"t":"Concept art and visual experiments","m":"style-neumorphism-music"},{"t":"A decorative media control","m":"style-neumorphism-concept"},{"t":"A small themed widget","m":"style-neumorphism-deco"},{"t":"Brand imagery where usability is not carried by the shadow alone","m":"style-neumorphism-widget"}],"dont":[{"t":"Build a dense form or dashboard entirely from low-contrast surfaces","m":"style-neumorphism-text-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Use shadow direction as the only selected state","m":"style-neumorphism-form-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Place small controls in bright outdoor viewing conditions","m":"style-neumorphism-button-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Assume soft appearance means easy interaction","m":"style-neumorphism-a11y-bad","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"Keep readable text and controls above contrast requirements","m":"style-neumorphism-twins"},{"t":"Use the effect on a small number of large surfaces","m":"style-neumorphism-samecolor"},{"t":"Add clear state changes beyond shadow direction","m":"style-neumorphism-extrude"},{"t":"Maintain one consistent light source","m":"style-neumorphism-soft"},{"t":"Provide visible outlines or color where function depends on the boundary","m":"style-neumorphism-contrast"}],"scenes":["Media control","Concept page","Themed widget","Decorative illustration"],"sceneUI":["<div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene\"><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-top\"><span>HOME / LIVING ROOM</span><b>23:14</b></div><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-content\"><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-dial\"><small>Indoor temperature</small><b>24°</b><span>Comfortable</span></div><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-controls\"><div><i class=\"lamp\"></i><b>Reading lamp</b><span>40% brightness</span></div><div class=\"pressed\"><i class=\"moon\"></i><b>Night Ambience</b><span>Enabled</span></div></div></div><div class=\"style-neumorphism-scene-note\">Low-risk control · Critical safety equipment does not use neomorphism</div></div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#e3e9f2;border-radius:18px;padding:24px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:18px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn big\">◐</span>\n        <span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn big in\">♪</span>\n        <span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:110px;height:44px;border-radius:22px;justify-content:flex-start;padding:0 8px\"><span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn\" style=\"width:30px;height:30px\"></span></span>\n        <span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip in\" style=\"width:110px;height:44px;border-radius:22px\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:320px;margin:18px auto 0\">\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-track\"><i style=\"width:62%\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-track\"><i style=\"width:30%\"></i></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#96a1b8;margin-top:16px\">Dribbble concept draft · Demonstrate skills, not online</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #eceef2;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">Workbench</div>\n      <div style=\"padding:16px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">This week’s data</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin:4px 0 8px\">The number of views and interactions are increasing, and they will continue to grow. </div>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand)\">View details →</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#e3e9f2;border-radius:14px;padding:12px\">\n          <span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:104px\">12k views</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:0 16px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Correct posture: a new mimic card is used as decoration, and the rest is as usual</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#e3e9f2;border-radius:18px;padding:26px\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto\">\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-name\" style=\"font-size:15px;text-align:center\">Login</div>\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-chip in\" style=\"width:100%;height:38px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:14px;justify-content:flex-start;padding:0 14px\">Email</div>\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-chip in\" style=\"width:100%;height:38px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:10px;justify-content:flex-start;padding:0 14px\">Password</div>\n        <div class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:100%;height:40px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:14px\">Login</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#c25454;text-align:center\">↑ Find the input box and login button - this is why it cannot go online</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"history":[{"year":"December 2019","title":"A banking concept goes viral","desc":"Alexander Plyuto's concept showed controls appearing to press out of a same-colored surface and drew exceptional attention on design platforms."},{"year":"2020","title":"Soft UI reaches its peak","desc":"The style gained the name Neumorphism, and tutorials, UI kits, and generators appeared across the design community."},{"year":"2020–2021","title":"Accessibility criticism follows","desc":"Very low contrast made controls and backgrounds difficult to distinguish, especially in bright conditions, so real product adoption stayed limited."},{"year":"Today","title":"The style returns to a decorative role","desc":"Neumorphism now appears mainly in concept work, media controls, and isolated accents rather than complete production interfaces."}]},"usageMocks":{"style-neumorphism-music":"<span class=\"style-neumorphism-panel\"><span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn\">⏮</span><span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn big\">▶</span><span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn\">⏭</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">适合重氛围、操作较少的局部界面</span>","style-neumorphism-concept":"<span class=\"style-neumorphism-panel\"><span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\"></span><span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip in\"></span><span class=\"style-neumorphism-btn\">◐</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">概念稿可以先验证材质方向和可读性</span>","style-neumorphism-deco":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:50%\"></i><span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:44px;height:28px\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">在常规界面中将新拟态限制在非关键区域</span></div>","style-neumorphism-widget":"<span class=\"style-neumorphism-panel\"><span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:76px;height:40px\">12:30</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">时钟、天气等以展示为主的界面</span>","style-neumorphism-text-bad":"<span class=\"style-neumorphism-panel\" style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:#8a95ab;line-height:1.8\">灰色正文和相近背景会降低长文可读性。</span></span>","style-neumorphism-form-bad":"<span class=\"style-neumorphism-panel\"><span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip in\" style=\"width:88px\">姓名？</span><span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:64px\">按钮？</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">输入框与背景边界不清楚</span>","style-neumorphism-button-bad":"<span class=\"style-neumorphism-panel\"><span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:88px\">立即购买</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">关键按钮缺少清楚的可点击状态</span>","style-neumorphism-a11y-bad":"<span class=\"style-neumorphism-panel\"><span class=\"style-neumorphism-chip\" style=\"width:76px\">阳光下</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">低对比度在明亮环境中更难识别</span>"}}}